: Shipped workspaces create/list/detail per design. Migration v2 + routes. read_state uses full ReadStateEntry {channel_id,last_read_seq,unread_count,mention_count}; include_archived accepts 1 and case-insensitive true. errors.py already broadened by MARATHON-4. Tests: tests/test_workspaces.py; full unit suite green; cluster verified create:8000 list:8001 detail:8002.\n=== MARATHON-7 ===\nclosed Channels: create, join, leave, topic, archive, pins\nnotes: Shipped channels create/join/leave/topic/archive + workspace join + pins. Migration v3 messages+channel_pins; assert_channel_writable → 423 archived for M8. Tests: test_channels.py + test_pins.py; full suite 175 passed. Cluster two-app shared data_dir covered.\n=== MARATHON-8 ===\nclosed Messages, threads, reactions REST API\nnotes: IMPL: Messages/threads/reactions REST shipped. Schema is migration v5 (design text said v4; v4 already used by MARATHON-12 groups/invitations). Additive only — preserved v3 messages. file_ids non-empty → 400 until MARATHON-10; @username mentions only; slash bodies stored literally. Unit tests green (151 excl. live/cluster port-bound); port 8000 held by another agent so live cluster pytest left unr\n=== MARATHON-12 ===\nclosed User groups and workspace invitations\nnotes: Shipped groups CRUD + workspace invitations (v4 migration + accept on-ramp). GroupObj/InvitationObj exact keys; invite_only join remains 403 without accept; accept adds workspace member + #general channel_members. Tests: test_groups.py + test_invitations.py; full suite 185 passed. Migration v4 apply/reverse verified.\n=== MARATHON-13 ===\nin_progress WebSocket subscribe/resume and dense channel seq\nnotes: Design complete for WS subscribe/resume + dense channel seq. Key decisions: SQLite channel_seq/channel_events (v6) as SoT; seq allocated in same txn as mutation; /api/ws?token=; subscribe=live only, resume=replay or resume.gap; user.updated global no seq; Redis fan-out deferred to MARATHON-14 (local hub + catch-up on a